WEBVTT

00:00:00,880 --> 00:00:18,210
How can I get my lymphocytes up? So your lymphocytes are one of your white blood cells. So,

00:00:18,210 --> 00:00:24,530
everything that you're doing to stimulate your immune response is going to be helping raise

00:00:24,530 --> 00:00:32,450
your lymphocytes. There isn't anything specific nutritionally that would be like, oh, just start

00:00:32,450 --> 00:00:38,850
doing this. You are already doing a bunch of stuff to help stimulate your immune responses.

00:00:38,850 --> 00:00:44,690
Those are the things that you're going to do to help stimulate your lymphocytes production. So

00:00:44,690 --> 00:00:52,930
there isn't really anything else that you could do but what you're doing.

